<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-RUTA DEL SOL THIRD STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-RUTA DEL SOL THIRD STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>JAEN, Spain 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the third</p>
<p>stage of the Ruta del Sol over 159 kms between Lucena and Jaen</p>
<p>on Tuesday:</p>
<p>1. Gines Salmeron (Spain) Saeco  4 hours 15 minutes 16 seconds</p>
<p>2. Erik Zabel (Germany) Telekom	     9 seconds behind</p>
<p>3. Johan Museeuw (Belgium) Mapei</p>
<p>4. David Etxebarria (Spain) ONCE</p>
<p>5. Ekimov Viatcheslav (Russia) U S  Postal</p>
<p>6. Aitor Bugallo (Spain) Euskadi</p>
<p>7. Francisco Cerezo (Spain) Toscaf</p>
<p>8. Herminio Diaz (Spain) ONCE</p>
